A_599 - Some problems can only be solved by praying and there are no technical solutions for this. For example, if we work or play and there are spiders in the room, it may be that their proximity and their waiting still allows them to interact in some way with our mind. Therefore, even without resorting to violence, if we want to somehow disassociate ourselves from these little insects this can be done with prayers (intelligently prepared and with respect).